  "quality": "C",
  "summary": "Abstract Riverine dissolved silicon (DSi) and biogenic silica (BSi) are modulated along the estuarine gradient by several biotic and abiotic processes governed by physical forcings. An important area controlling silicon transport in alluvia",
  "tags": [],
  "content_fetched": true,
  "pdf": "kb/pdf/8cd72f531be5f263.pdf",
  "cid": "8cd72f531be5f263",
  "importance": 5.59,
