 {
  "title": "Anthropogenic impact and antibiotic resistance among the indicator and pathogenic bacteria from several industrial and sewage discharge points along the coast from Pydibhimavaram to Tuni, East Coast of India",
  "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/s10661-023-11083-2",
